// flyout surfaces are targeted. Hard-coded offsets, fixed widths, forced light
// themes, hidden controls, Action Center/toast rewrites and broad universal
// selectors are intentionally excluded. Opacity values are nudged by a few
// hundredths around the reference values; layout remains native and pixel-aligned.
