// 0a88a6e0ef6b1752fea36e581cffff1097e862b0), credited as a reference for the idea;
// no code is copied and no SimpleWindowSwitcher is bundled.
// All new boundaries catch C++ exceptions, NOT access violations/SEH.
// ===========================================================================
